# Derived data does not round-trip through git; the database holds it. The
# whole directory: the panel and the backtest output (local caches of a
# computation), the AIP PDF cache, the local copy of period_flags the offline
# scripts read, and anything fetched on demand such as Brent. See
# architecture.md, "Observations belong in the warehouse, configuration
# belongs in git".
data/
!research/art/fuel_price_anatomy.gif

# The dbt profile carries a warehouse endpoint and is not committed.
# `.devcontainer` points DBT_PROFILES_DIR here; see .devcontainer/README.md.
.dbt/

# The owner's working notes: open items with dates, names of people contacted,
# what can be paid for. The repository is public; the notes are not. Claude
# Code still loads the file from disk; it is in history up to 13 Nov 2026.
.claude/rules/active-items.md

# go-task writes a local id here; not shared state.
.user.yml
.task/
